# Copy to .private-denylist (gitignored) and replace these placeholders with real private words.
# One term per line; whole-word, case-insensitive; "#" starts a comment.
# CI reads the same list from the repository secret PRIVATE_DENYLIST (newline- or comma-separated).
# The scanner never prints a matched term, only file:line and denylist[#n].
example-real-first-name
example-real-surname
example-personal-handle
example-private-hostname
example-personal-domain
example-handle-of-any-other-github-account-you-own
